sentences.text:
The complainant prayed before the Trial Court to summon,
try,
and punish  the accused, and direct the payment of compensation.

The proper  approach  is  to  first  determine  if  the  accused  has  rebutted the  presumption;
 only  then,
 if  rebutted,
 does  the  onus  shift back to the c o m p l a i n a n t .

All pending  applications,
 if  any,
 also stand disposed of.

